ub.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Scope\nExtend the direct-chat media delivery Emulator regression to assert that no signed delivery URL is issued to an unauthenticated caller, when the media sender has a suspended account, or when the recipient has a suspended account. The test restores fixture account states before continuing the existing block/deletion/scope-mismatch/intruder checks.\n\n## Evidence boundary\nTest-only change to `functions/test/integration/media-callables.integration.test.js`. No production media behavior, Storage rules, retention policy, deployment or production resources changed.\n\n## Validation\nRequire exact-head Validate Mawda and Mawdda Domain Regression before merge.\n\n## Security fix added after source review\nThe delivery callable previously used a local allow/deny list of four accountStatus strings for direct-chat participants. That was weaker than the shared `isMemberAccountInGoodStanding` policy, which also rejects explicit unknown statuses and the `isBanned` / `isSuspended` flags. This PR now reuses the canonical predicate for both viewer and peer, and the Emulator regression covers unauthenticated access, suspended accountStatus, boolean suspension/ban flags and unknown explicit statuses on both sides. Existing block, per-user deletion, scope mismatch and intruder denials remain covered.\n\n\n## Exact-head workflow update — 2026-11-20\n- Head SHA: `b72522af9c3eaf7e4c3585514c23c53e5cfa9f7e`.\n- Mawdda Domain Regression run `44725545509`: success; 17/17 backend domain steps and 9/9 Flutter UI steps.\n- Validate Mawda run `44725545496`: ClamAV scanner job passed, including real GIF/audio/video/PDF sanitization and EICAR detection; Flutter analysis/tests and standard web build passed. Cloud Functions integration is at final Firestore/Storage emulator backup/restore step, and production-configured web candidate build is still running. Keep this PR Draft until the full run concludes.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T11:09:56Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:54:19Z","closed_at":"2026-11-20T11:18:15Z","merged_at":"2026-11-20T11:18:15Z","merge_commit_sha":"818b004f82759426699f47193c7ef8d22b870315","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"productionhome2022-hash:codex/phase1-media-direct-delivery-denials-2026-11-20","ref":"codex/phase1-media-direct-delivery-denials-2026-11-20","repo":{"id":1446343181,"node_id":"R_kgDOVjVyDQ","name":"mawda-platform","full_name":"productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform","owner":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled"